      "writtenOn": "2019-05-03T16:29:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically no, but I was trying to minimize when the hackiness comes into play, to keep any unforeseen side effects isolated to when s0ix is failing anyway.",
      "parentUuid": "a593fa21_8c1cadd7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 278,
